<title>SWITZERLAND: Nestle confident 4.0 pct plus vol growth.</title>
<headline>Nestle confident 4.0 pct plus vol growth.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Helmut Maucher, chairman and chief executive of Nestle SA said he was disappointed in the 2.2 percent volume growth in first quarter sales, but he was confident that volume growth would exceed four percent for the full year.</p>
<p>Maucher told a news conference that the 2.2 percent first quarter growth &quot;disappoints us&quot;.</p>
<p>He added volume growth in March had reached 4.7 percent.</p>
<p>&quot;Our estimate for the year is 4.7 percent,&quot; Maucher said, adding:</p>
<p>&quot;I am rather certain it (sales volume growth) will be over four percent, which is our goal.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
